    "name": "SparkArrayContains",
    "owner": null,
    "crate": "datafusion-spark",
    "version": "55.1.0",
    "kind": "struct",
    "signature": "struct SparkArrayContains",
    "docs": "Spark-compatible `array_contains` function.\n\nCalls DataFusion's `array_has` and then applies Spark's null semantics:\n- If the result from `array_has` is `true`, return `true`.\n- If the result is `false` and the input array row contains any null elements,\n  return `null` (because the element might have been the null).\n- If the result is `false` and the input array row has no null elements,\n  return `false`.",
